      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If you could age gate individual toggles, it would be such a confusing mess. How would you know you're missing out on avatar features because you're unverified? Menus could be grayed out, sure, but what if someone else is using the avatar?\n\nI think it's better to just use the existing content warning system, the fallback models will inform you that you're missing out and what is blocking those avatars.\n\nEither an avatar is safe for all ages, or it isn't. No halfsies.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
