      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I want to bump this with the recent video about content gating coming back. If the content tags were built in parameters applied to all avatars when they loaded, it would be a nice way for creators to keep content compliant with the users wishes automatically with hiding or blocking the whole avatar. I would definitely use this if it was a feature. Yeas it would be more work on the creator's end, but it worth it to me and I'm sure others.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
